            "id": "https://vutranthanhed.github.io/news/research-workshop-crafting-a-scholarly-argument-for-your-paper/",
            "url": "https://vutranthanhed.github.io/news/research-workshop-crafting-a-scholarly-argument-for-your-paper/",
            "title": "[Research Workshop] Crafting a Scholarly Argument for Your Paper",
            "summary": "Developing a compelling scholarly argument is often one of the most challenging aspects of academic writing. How do you move beyond presenting data to positioning your voice within the wider academic conversation? Join us for an interactive, hands-on workshop led by Dr Tran Thanh Vu,&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Developing a compelling scholarly argument is often one of the most challenging aspects of academic writing. How do you move beyond presenting data to positioning your voice within the wider academic conversation?</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">Join us for an interactive, hands-on workshop led by <strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"53\">Dr Tran Thanh Vu</strong>, designed specifically for early-career researchers and TERECONET members looking to sharpen their paper’s core message and structure!</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What We Will Explore</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Understanding Scholarly Argumentation:</strong> What makes an argument truly scholarly?</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Purpose &amp; Value:</strong> Why is a clear argument essential for publication success?</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Developing Your Argument:</strong> Practical steps to build a strong argument using data and theoretical frameworks.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Event Details</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Date:</strong> Friday, 28 August 2026</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Time:</strong> 02:00 PM – 05:00 PM (3 hours)</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Venue:</strong> Room 56 (Floor 5), Phuong Nam Education, 357 Le Hong Phong Street, Vuon Lai Ward, Ho Chi Minh City (<a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/kfJMYrwu4gx6UH8p8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Maps</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"13\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration &amp; Entry Fees</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">TERECONET Core Members:</strong> 50,000 VND</li>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"14,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">General Participants &amp; Event Alumni:</strong> 120,000 VND</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1\"><i data-path-to-node=\"14,1,1\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">(Fees directly contribute to venue rental and event service costs.)</i></p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"15\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"15\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Registration</strong></h3>\n<p> </p>\n<!-- Registration Form Embed -->\n<div class=\"registration-form-container\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">Registration closed.</span></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>",
